sequenceDiagram
    participant Proxy as llm-d Inference Proxy
    participant TrainingSvc as training-service<br/>ClusterIP 8000/TCP
    participant Training as Training Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant PredSvc as prediction-service<br/>ClusterIP 80/TCP
    participant Prediction as Prediction Server<br/>8001/TCP HTTP
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus
    participant K8s as Kubernetes<br/>kubelet

    Note over Training,Prediction: No authentication on any endpoint.<br/>Platform-level network isolation expected.

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note right of Proxy: Flow 1: Telemetry Ingestion
        Proxy->>TrainingSvc: POST /add_training_data_bulk<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP, No Auth
        TrainingSvc->>Training: Forward to port 8000
        Training->>Training: Accumulate telemetry data<br/>in memory (partitioned by model)
        Training-->>TrainingSvc: 200 OK
        TrainingSvc-->>Proxy: Response
        Training->>Training: Periodically retrain<br/>XGBoost + LightGBM models<br/>(TTFT & TPOT)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note right of Prediction: Flow 2: Model Distribution (Background)
        loop Every MODEL_SYNC_INTERVAL_SEC (default 10s)
            Prediction->>Training: GET /model/{name}/info<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP, No Auth
            Training-->>Prediction: Model metadata + timestamps
            alt Server model newer than local
                Prediction->>Training: GET /model/{name}/download<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP, No Auth
                Training-->>Prediction: Model artifact bytes
                Prediction->>Prediction: Write to local disk<br/>Verify with MD5 checksum<br/>Load into predictor
            end
        end
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note right of Proxy: Flow 3: Prediction Serving
        Proxy->>PredSvc: POST /predict<br/>HTTP 80/TCP, No Auth
        PredSvc->>Prediction: Forward to port 8001
        Prediction->>Prediction: Apply synced ML models<br/>Estimate TTFT & TPOT
        Prediction-->>PredSvc: JSON prediction response
        PredSvc-->>Proxy: Response

        Note right of Proxy: Bulk prediction variants
        Proxy->>PredSvc: POST /predict/bulk<br/>HTTP 80/TCP, No Auth
        PredSvc->>Prediction: Forward to port 8001
        Prediction-->>PredSvc: Bulk predictions
        PredSvc-->>Proxy: Response

        Proxy->>PredSvc: POST /predict/bulk/strict<br/>HTTP 80/TCP, No Auth
        PredSvc->>Prediction: Forward to port 8001
        Prediction-->>PredSvc: Strict bulk predictions
        PredSvc-->>Proxy: Response
    end

    rect rgb(245, 240, 255)
        Note right of Prometheus: Flow 4: Observability
        Prometheus->>TrainingSvc: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP
        TrainingSvc->>Training: Forward
        Training-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics

        K8s->>Training: GET /healthz (liveness)<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP
        Training-->>K8s: 200 OK
        K8s->>Training: GET /readyz (readiness)<br/>HTTP 8000/TCP
        Training-->>K8s: 200 OK

        K8s->>Prediction: GET /healthz (liveness)<br/>HTTP 8001/TCP
        Prediction-->>K8s: 200 OK
        K8s->>Prediction: GET /readyz (readiness)<br/>HTTP 8001/TCP
        Prediction-->>K8s: 200 OK
    end
